<http://data.silknow.org/object/64d29ef6-9182-3d68-ae3c-53b370e4c2ee/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Darning or running stitch sampler. Square central compartment with a stylized basket above the initials \"HGM\". Flanking this is the word \"ANNO\" and the date 18--. Surrounding are characteristic cross-like motifs with geometric and linear filling patterns, plus various vases, baskets and urns etc.; some containing initials. In each corner is a repeating simple sun design with a pair of initials.  Slightly stained and soiled; some colors have run.  Stitches: cross, eyelet, marking cross, pattern darning, simple darning."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/64d29ef6-9182-3d68-ae3c-53b370e4c2ee> .

<http://data.silknow.org/object/64d29ef6-9182-3d68-ae3c-53b370e4c2ee/category/1>
